					<div id="elementor-tab-content-8804" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-8804"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Post-treatment recovery involves managing mild discomfort and following your dentist&#8217;s guidelines. Proper oral hygiene and regular follow-ups are essential for a smooth recovery.</span></p></div>
