<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Modern dentistry has made great strides in making </span><b>root canal treatments</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> more comfortable and pain-free. Thanks to </span><b>cutting-edge technology</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, the entire procedure is faster and less invasive.</span></p>
