<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>A1.</strong> The </span><b>cost of teeth whitening in India</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> varies from ₹7,000 for basic in-office treatments to ₹20,000 for advanced procedures like laser teeth whitening.</span></p>
