<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Researching Dental Clinics: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">Start by researching dental clinics online. Check reviews and ratings to find the best orthodontic clinics in India. Scheduling consultations with multiple clinics can help in comparing prices and services.</span></li>
